{
  "name": "zero-coverage-file",
  "domain": "tech-test",
  "format": "test-inventory-and-coverage",
  "description": "整个文件在覆盖报告里连条目都没有 —— 这是最常见也最容易被漏掉的一类缺口：它不是「某几行没跑到」，而是「这个文件根本没被报告覆盖」。同时放入一个每行都有命中的文件作为对照，证明「有覆盖」不会被误报。",
  "input": {
    "format": "test-inventory-and-coverage",
    "payload": {
      "cases": [
        {
          "id": "t1",
          "file": "src/core/engine.spec.ts",
          "assertions": [
            {
              "kind": "equals",
              "target": "run"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "coverage": {
        "files": {
          "src/core/engine.ts": {
            "lines": {
              "1": 2,
              "2": 2,
              "3": 2
            },
            "branches": {
              "if@2": 2
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "source": {
        "src/legacy/report.ts": {
          "lines": [
            "export function legacyReport(rows: Row[]): string {",
            "  return rows",
            "    .map((row) => row.label)",
            "    .join(', ')",
            "}"
          ]
        },
        "src/core/engine.ts": {
          "lines": [
            "export function run(input: string): string {",
            "  if (!input) return ''",
            "  return input.trim()",
            "}"
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "expect": {
    "candidates": 1,
    "paths": [
      "src/legacy/report.ts"
    ],
    "admitted": 1,
    "excludedByPredicate": {},
    "bounded": true,
    "truncated": false
  },
  "anchors": {
    "positive": [
      {
        "note": "CHANGED (t23)：零覆盖文件的可核验形式是「报告**显式列出该文件、且没有任何命中**」，而不是「报告里根本没有这个文件」——后者是「没有数据」，不是「数据表明未覆盖」。改前这里给的是空的 files 表，等于凭「不给数据」换取 anchored；现在改成显式的零命中条目，锚点照样成立，而且是真被核验过的。",
        "claim": {
          "kind": "case-and-covered-line",
          "path": "src/legacy/report.ts",
          "locator": {},
          "excerpt": "export function legacyReport(rows: Row[]): string {"
        },
        "subject": {
          "path": "src/legacy/report.ts",
          "content": "export function legacyReport(rows: Row[]): string {\n  return rows\n    .map((row) => row.label)\n    .join(', ')\n}",
          "coverage": {
            "files": {
              "src/legacy/report.ts": {
                "lines": {}
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "expectStatus": "anchored",
        "expectTier": "recomputed-unique",
        "expectStart": 1
      }
    ],
    "negative": [
      {
        "note": "CHANGED (t23)：同一段原文、同一个位置，但报告里**连该文件的条目都没有** —— 没有数据不等于数据表明未覆盖，必须判未锚定。这是 F2 的负例：改前它会 anchored。",
        "claim": {
          "kind": "case-and-covered-line",
          "path": "src/legacy/report.ts",
          "locator": {},
          "excerpt": "export function legacyReport(rows: Row[]): string {"
        },
        "subject": {
          "path": "src/legacy/report.ts",
          "content": "export function legacyReport(rows: Row[]): string {\n  return rows\n    .map((row) => row.label)\n    .join(', ')\n}",
          "coverage": {
            "files": {
              "src/core/engine.ts": {
                "lines": {
                  "1": 2
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "expectStatus": "unanchored",
        "expectTier": "locator-mismatch"
      },
      {
        "note": "对照文件每行都有命中：同一个 verifier 必须拒绝把「有覆盖」当成缺口，否则零覆盖的判定没有意义。",
        "claim": {
          "kind": "case-and-covered-line",
          "path": "src/core/engine.ts",
          "locator": {},
          "excerpt": "return input.trim()"
        },
        "subject": {
          "path": "src/core/engine.ts",
          "content": "export function run(input: string): string {\n  if (!input) return ''\n  return input.trim()\n}",
          "coverage": {
            "files": {
              "src/core/engine.ts": {
                "lines": {
                  "1": 2,
                  "2": 2,
                  "3": 2
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "expectStatus": "unanchored",
        "expectTier": "locator-mismatch"
      }
    ]
  }
}
